:''For the harder version, see [[Sniper Cat (Veteran)|Thursday Blitz Stage]].''
The '''Thursday Stage''' (木曜ステージ, ''Mokuyō Sutēji'', '''Thursday Stage''') contains three levels, each with a chance to drop a [[Sniper the Cat]] when completed. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.3 Update|Version 2.0.3]].

